INTERPRETATION
The two-dimensional value-channel rescue first observed in B11 generalizes to B7's full-width multiplicative role geometry.
This strengthens the conclusion that scalar value/superposition capacity, rather than one specific role geometry, was the dominant B6-B10 bottleneck.
